## Overview

### What This Guide Covers

| Feature | Purpose | User Experience |
|---------|---------|-----------------|
| **Fullscreen PWA** | Hide browser chrome, app-like feel | No address bar, immersive experience |
| **Swipe Back** | Navigate back with gesture | iOS/Android native feel |

### Display Mode Comparison

| Mode | Browser UI | Status Bar | Use Case |
|------|-----------|------------|----------|
| `browser` | Full UI | System | Regular websites |
| `standalone` | Hidden | Visible | **Recommended for most PWAs** |
| `fullscreen` | Hidden | Hidden | Games, media players |
| `minimal-ui` | Minimal | Visible | Navigation needed |

