## Gesture Navigation

### useSwipeBack Hook

Enables swipe-right-to-go-back gesture (like native iOS/Android apps):

```javascript
import { useEffect, useRef } from 'react';
import { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';

/**
 * Swipe-right gesture to navigate back
 * @param {Object} options
 * @param {boolean} options.disabled - Disable gesture
 * @param {number} options.threshold - Min pixels to trigger (default: 50)
 * @param {number} options.maxVertical - Max vertical drift allowed (default: 80)
 */
export function useSwipeBack({ 
  disabled = false, 
  threshold = 50, 
  maxVertical = 80 
} = {}) {
  const navigate = useNavigate();
  const startX = useRef(0);
  const startY = useRef(0);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (disabled) return;

    const onTouchStart = (e) => {
      startX.current = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
      startY.current = e.changedTouches[0].screenY;
    };

    const onTouchEnd = (e) => {
      const dx = startX.current - e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
      const dy = Math.abs(startY.current - e.changedTouches[0].screenY);

      // Ignore if:
      // - Too much vertical movement (scrolling, not swiping)
      // - Not swiped right enough
      // - No history to go back to
      if (dy >= maxVertical) return;
      if (dx >= -threshold) return;
      if (window.history.length <= 1) return;

      navigate(-1);
    };

    // Use passive listeners for better scroll performance
    document.addEventListener('touchstart', onTouchStart, { passive: true });
    document.addEventListener('touchend', onTouchEnd, { passive: true });

    return () => {
      document.removeEventListener('touchstart', onTouchStart);
      document.removeEventListener('touchend', onTouchEnd);
    };
  }, [disabled, threshold, maxVertical, navigate]);
}
```

### Usage with Path Exclusions

```jsx
// App.jsx
const SWIPE_DISABLED_PATHS = new Set([
  '/login',
  '/role-select', 
  '/marketplace',
  '/gallery',  // Has its own horizontal swipe
]);

function App() {
  const { pathname } = useLocation();
  
  useSwipeBack({ 
    disabled: SWIPE_DISABLED_PATHS.has(pathname) 
  });
  
  return <Routes>...</Routes>;
}
```

### Gesture Parameters

| Parameter | Default | Description |
|-----------|---------|-------------|
| `threshold` | 50px | Minimum horizontal swipe to trigger back |
| `maxVertical` | 80px | Max vertical movement before ignoring |

### Why These Values?

- **50px**: Comfortable swipe distance, prevents accidental triggers
- **80px**: Allows natural scroll while still catching deliberate swipes

