### Standalone Detection

| Browser | Detection Method | Reliability |
|---------|-----------------|-------------|
| Chrome Android | `display-mode: standalone` | ✅ Reliable |
| Edge Android | `display-mode: standalone` | ✅ Reliable |
| Opera Android | `display-mode: standalone` | ✅ Reliable |
| Samsung Internet | `display-mode: standalone` | ✅ Reliable |
| Firefox Android | `display-mode: standalone` | ✅ Reliable |
| Safari iOS | `navigator.standalone` | ✅ Reliable |
| Chrome iOS | Limited (WebKit wrapper) | ⚠️ Partial |
| WebView/TWA | `document.referrer` | ✅ Reliable |

### Fullscreen API

| Browser | Support | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|
| Chrome | ✅ Full | `requestFullscreen()` |
| Edge | ✅ Full | `requestFullscreen()` |
| Safari | ✅ Webkit | `webkitRequestFullscreen()` |
| Firefox | ✅ Full | `requestFullscreen()` |
| Opera | ✅ Full | `requestFullscreen()` |

